{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CfE9E4Ync9qJwBxumJkDy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01StaSAiqGFkUsi1EJqGsgR6","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> docs/decisions.md <<'EOF'\n\n## 2026-09-20 — AGENTS.md is the agent instruction file; CLAUDE.md imports it\n\nDecided: `AGENTS.md` at the repo root is the single instruction set for coding agents, and `CLAUDE.md` is a one-line `@AGENTS.md` import so Claude Code loads the same text. It points at `CONTRIBUTING.md` for conventions rather than restating them, and makes the pre-commit / pre-push check (`go vet`, `go test -race`, `golangci-lint run`, scoped to touched packages per commit and module-wide before push) an explicit required step. Rejected: two copies of the same content (drift), a symlink (not portable across every checkout), and `CLAUDE.md` as the canonical file (`AGENTS.md` is the vendor-neutral name other agent CLIs read).\nEOF\ngit diff --stat","description":"Append decision entry for agent instruction files"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":612,"cache_read_input_tokens":38106,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":612},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4492632f-0070-4622-92dd-b22af5201b50","uuid":"7bd952b1-3b1f-4e5b-afe2-fe85cafc6226","timestamp":"2026-09-20T05:31:12.306Z","request_id":"req_011CfE9E432HU6d68hMevSty","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01StaSAiqGFkUsi1EJqGsgR6":{"command":"cat >> docs/decisions.md <<'EOF'\n\n## 2026-09-20 — AGENTS.md is the agent instruction file; CLAUDE.md imports it\n\nDecided: `AGENTS.md` at the repo root is the single instruction set for coding agents, and `CLAUDE.md` is a one-line `@AGENTS.md` import so Claude Code loads the same text. It points at `CONTRIBUTING.md` for conventions rather than restating them, and makes the pre-commit / pre-push check (`go vet`, `go test -race`, `golangci-lint run`, scoped to touched packages per commit and module-wide before push) an explicit required step. Rejected: two copies of the same content (drift), a symlink (not portable across every checkout), and `CLAUDE.md` as the canonical file (`AGENTS.md` is the vendor-neutral name other agent CLIs read).\nEOF\ngit diff --stat","description":"Append decision entry for agent instruction files"}}}
